==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}}, from {{etyl|ML.|en}} {{m|la|recommendatio}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˌɹɛkəmɛnˈdeɪʃən/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|eɪʃən|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An act of [[recommend|recommending]].
# That which is recommended.
# A [[commendation]] or [[endorsement]].

====Synonyms====
* See also [[Wikisaurus:advice]]

